<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body data-new-gr-c-s-loaded="14.1045.0" style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><br />
Thanks for contacting Qantas Freight. We’ve received your request and your reference number is {!Case.CaseNumber}.
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Your query details:
<br/>
<br/>


<table cellpadding="5" style="border-collapse: collapse" width="860" border="0">
<tr>
   <td>Invoice Number:</td>
     <td>{!Case.Freight_AWB_Number__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Agent Account Number:</td>
<td>{!Case.Agent_Organisation_Name__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Comments:</td>
<td>{!Case.Description}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Air Way Bill: </td>
<td>{!Case.Freight_AWB_s__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Amount in AUD:</td>
<td>{!Case.Refund_Amount__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Reason for Query :</td>
<td>{!Case.Request_Reason_Others__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Return Email Address : </td>
<td>{!Case.SuppliedEmail}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Contact Name : </td>
<td>{!Case.SuppliedName}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Contact Telephone Number : </td>
<td>{!Case.SuppliedPhone}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td >Company Name : </td>
<td>{!Case.SuppliedCompany}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Date/time of Query Submission: </td>
<td>{!Case.CreatedDate}</td>
</tr>
</table>
<br/>
<br/>
We’ll do our best to get back to you as soon as we can.<br />
<br/>
<br />
Thanks for your patience,<br />
The Qantas Freight Team<br />
<br />
<font color="white">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font> <br/>
<br/>
<footer><img src="https://qantas.lightning.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FHvlL&oid=00D8s00000IDoz7&lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Freight Logo" /></footer>
</body>
</html>